change       = "Periodically anchor OverallRoot on Paxeer via the tools/ attest surface (D4: chain coupling ONLY in tools/; cortex still signs nothing — the agent runtime/tools sign the manifest). Anchoring is opt-in (D10) and additive: it NEVER changes how OverallRoot is computed or how replay works. Store the anchor tx as provenance (Event). Coordinate with Andrew + chain availability (v1.1 gating)."
